---
description: Infrastructure changes require plan review, least privilege and environment isolation
globs:
  - "infrastructure/**"
  - "**/*.tf"
  - "**/*.tfvars"
---

For IaC:
- separate dev/staging/prod state
- do not commit secrets
- review plan before apply
- flag destroy/replace/public exposure
- use least-privilege IAM
- protect production databases/storage
- update infrastructure docs and PROGRESS.md after material changes
